- (Ayumi) Yeah - (Genta) Then we have to run away.

1390
01:16:08.105 --> 01:16:08.188
- (Ayumi) Yeah - (Genta) Then we have to run away.

1391
01:16:08.188 --> 01:16:09.564
- (Ayumi) Yeah - (Genta) Then we have to run away.

